# [Fabricator Recipes](recipes)

Recipes for the Fabricator, authored as data. One heading per recipe. The Engineering
Fabricator lists these; a build consumes the Inputs and, after Time seconds, yields the
Output into the managed build inventory. Program carries extra data stamped on the output
(for beacons, the kind; the monster + attract/repel come from the Weapons request).

## [Bio Beacon](recipe_beacon_bio)
---
Output: Beacon
Inputs: bio_sample x1, salvage x5
Time: 30
Build at: engineering
Program: kind=bio
---
A distress-beacon hull rewired to broadcast an ultrawave carrier that attracts or repels a
chosen space monster across the sector.

## [Sensor Beacon](recipe_beacon_sensor)
---
Output: Beacon
Inputs: salvage x8
Time: 20
Build at: engineering
Program: kind=sensor
---
A passive relay that brightens sensor returns around its position - a future kind; drops
and scans like any beacon.
